@TodoApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5047

### GET - Get all
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast
Accept: application/json
###

### GET - Get by ID
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/1
Accept: application/json
###

### POST - Create
POST {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "date": "2026-09-28",
    "temperatureC": 25,
    "summary": "Warm"
}
###

### PUT - Update
PUT {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "date": "2026-09-28",
    "temperatureC": 30,
    "summary": "Hot"
}
###

### DELETE - Delete
DELETE {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/1